<document xmlns="http://dlmf.nist.gov/LaTeXML">
  <resource src="LaTeXML.css" type="text/css"/>
  <resource src="ltx-article.css" type="text/css"/>
  <title>Unary minus after a relation (issue 535)</title>
  <para xml:id="p1">
    <p>Unary minus after a relation <Math mode="inline" tex="a=-b" text="a = - b" xml:id="p1.m1">
        <XMath>
          <XMApp>
            <XMTok meaning="equals" role="RELOP">=</XMTok>
            <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">a</XMTok>
            <XMApp>
              <XMTok meaning="minus" role="ADDOP">-</XMTok>
              <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">b</XMTok>
            </XMApp>
          </XMApp>
        </XMath>
      </Math>; a genuine BINARY minus must keep its infix spacing <Math mode="inline" tex="a-b" text="a - b" xml:id="p1.m2">
        <XMath>
          <XMApp>
            <XMTok meaning="minus" role="ADDOP">-</XMTok>
            <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">a</XMTok>
            <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">b</XMTok>
          </XMApp>
        </XMath>
      </Math>; a unary PLUS after a relation <Math mode="inline" tex="a=+b" text="a = + b" xml:id="p1.m3">
        <XMath>
          <XMApp>
            <XMTok meaning="equals" role="RELOP">=</XMTok>
            <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">a</XMTok>
            <XMApp>
              <XMTok meaning="plus" role="ADDOP">+</XMTok>
              <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">b</XMTok>
            </XMApp>
          </XMApp>
        </XMath>
      </Math>; a unary minus after a non-equals relation <Math mode="inline" tex="a\leq-b" text="a &lt;= - b" xml:id="p1.m4">
        <XMath>
          <XMApp>
            <XMTok meaning="less-than-or-equals" name="leq" role="RELOP">≤</XMTok>
            <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">a</XMTok>
            <XMApp>
              <XMTok meaning="minus" role="ADDOP">-</XMTok>
              <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">b</XMTok>
            </XMApp>
          </XMApp>
        </XMath>
      </Math>; and an align-style continuation with an absent left operand <Math mode="inline" tex="=-x" text="absent = - x" xml:id="p1.m5">
        <XMath>
          <XMApp>
            <XMTok meaning="equals" role="RELOP">=</XMTok>
            <XMTok meaning="absent"/>
            <XMApp>
              <XMTok meaning="minus" role="ADDOP">-</XMTok>
              <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">x</XMTok>
            </XMApp>
          </XMApp>
        </XMath>
      </Math>.</p>
  </para>
